OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FMostly cloudy in the west on
OL,6,FTuesday, with sunny spells developing
OL,7,Fin the east. Feeling warm in the
OL,8,Fsunshine, with light winds. Outbreaks
OL,9,Fof rain likely overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fon Wednesday with outbreaks of rain,
OL,13,Fheavy at times. Rain clearing
OL,14,Fovernight, followed by a fine and
OL,15,Fsunny Thursday after a chilly start.
OL,16,FFurther rain possible on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
